{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpfJgBPXKLnoVzKpYPik","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9206\",\n    \"customer\": \"BlueRiver Logistics (ERP C-1002)\",\n    \"current_limit\": 100000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 200000,\n    \"date\": \"2025-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Michael Torres (VP Sales, EMP-200)\",\n    \"basis\": \"standard\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 300000,\n    \"basis\": \"Standard account tier per CREDIT-POLICY-2025; no credit support in force\",\n    \"late_invoices\": []\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"CREDIT-POLICY-2025 (effective 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31)\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Priya Shah\",\n        \"role\": \"Finance Manager (EMP-401)\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Request dated 2025-09-23 falls within CREDIT-POLICY-2025 term (2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31)\",\n    \"Customer: BlueRiver Logistics, account tier Standard (CRM-2051), DUNS 07-331-9025\",\n    \"Standard tier maximum under CREDIT-POLICY-2025: $300,000; requested limit $200,000 is within maximum\",\n    \"Payment history (12 months before request): INV-61005 due 2025-03-01 paid 2025-02-26 (5 days early); INV-61210 due 2025-05-30 paid 2025-05-28 (2 days early); INV-61433 due 2025-08-29 paid 2025-09-02 (4 days late, within 45-day tolerance). No late or unpaid invoices exceed 45 days\",\n    \"Requestor Michael Torres holds title VP Sales (EMP-200), not a role with approval authority under CREDIT-POLICY-2025\",\n    \"CREDIT-POLICY-2025 Section 3: credit limits >$50,000 and ≤$750,000 require Finance Manager approval\",\n    \"Requested limit $200,000